            "id": 146685,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>console.log(\"Game start!\");</code> al blocco di codice del ciclo while inserendolo tra <code>{</code> e <code>}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>while (true) {</code>, seguito da <code>console.log(\"Game start!\");</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
